Stop, I'm not your nurse,

7
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:46,640
stop thinking
that I have no life.

8
00:03:48,006 --> 00:03:50,140
Nice, as usual.

9
00:03:50,406 --> 00:03:52,173
No, I was going out

10
