do something
important, not work.

11
00:03:54,606 --> 00:03:56,206
I won't say anything,
it's my business.

12
00:03:58,006 --> 00:04:00,406
Okay I will try.

13
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:07,440
I don't know if it will
be a handsome guy!

14
00:04:07,873 --> 00:04:09,640
Okay goodbye.

15
00:06:12,606 --> 00:06:14,406
- Come in.
- THANKS.

16
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:23,206
I am Dr. Galbiati.
What do you want ?

17
00:06:23,406 --> 00:06:25,473
I need an appointment
with Dr. Villanova.

18
00:06:25,673 --> 00:06:28,040
- Are you his patient?
- No.

19
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,806
Who referred you to us?

20
00:06:31,006 --> 00:06:34,173
The plate, I pass
often, I noticed it and...

21
00:06:34,373 --> 00:06:36,006
I'll take a look at the diary.

22
00:06:40,573 --> 00:06:45,240
What must be clear is that, one
cannot control the subconscious.

23
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:57,940
You will have to wait before
you can see the doctor.

24
00:06:58,473 --> 00:07:00,640
At least a month and a half.

25
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,240
He has no free space.

26
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:05,673
Me if you want, I
can in two weeks.

27
00:07:05,873 --> 00:07:07,406
Yes OK.

28
00:07:07,606 --> 00:07:10,206
Thursday 6, 4:30 p.m.

29
00:07:11,173 --> 00:07:13,806
- In what name?
- Bollani, Roberta.

30
00:07:15,673 --> 00:07:17,473
I will wait for Madame Bollani.

31
00:07:17,673 --> 00:07:20,340
It's not me, it's my best
friend, she's a lawyer.

32
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:23,640
She's busy and she
asked me to find a therapist.

33
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,640
I find the right people,
for her and others,

34
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:29,040
I am a real disaster for myself!

35
00:07:29,806 --> 00:07:33,806
I don't believe in therapy, you
have to solve your problems yourself.

36
00:07:34,006 --> 00:07:37,273
Paying someone to listen
to my failures is the limit!

37
00:07:38,073 --> 00:07:39,673
I talk too much ?  Maybe.

38
00:07:40,673 --> 00:07:43,406
I'm going to tell my
friend, she'll be happy.

39
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:46,640
You won't fuck with me!

40
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:49,673
It's not the first time
you say something

41
00:07:49,873 --> 00:07:51,940
and that I discover
that it is bullshit!

42
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:54,873
I never imposed limits on you!

43
00:07:55,073 --> 00:07:57,240
Have I ever been painful?

44
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,973
I do not believe.

45
00:08:00,673 --> 00:08:03,273
I don't care, okay?

46
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:09,806
A cappuccino, please.

47
00:08:10,006 --> 00:08:11,340
warm.

48
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:16,373
How can I bear to
be with a guy like you?

49
00:08:16,573 --> 00:08:18,440
You are a jerk!

50
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,040
PSY OK

51
00:08:25,473 --> 00:08:26,806
THANKS.

52
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,740
One moment, the sugar...

53
00:08:32,006 --> 00:08:34,206
it's brown sugar, I
don't know if it's good.

54
00:08:36,006 --> 00:08:37,340
THANKS.

55
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,340
My scooter!

56
00:09:22,873 --> 00:09:25,340
Did you hurt yourself?
Let me help you.

57
00:09:25,540 --> 00:09:27,806
What a bitch!
Your daughter has ruined my bike!

58
00:09:28,006 --> 00:09:31,373
She's not my daughter, so
shut up.  Give me your hand.

59
00:09:31,573 --> 00:09:33,973
Hanging on the
phone, she fell like shit.

60
00:09:34,406 --> 00:09:36,006
Calm down !

61
00:09:40,206 --> 00:09:41,773
Where's the phone?

62
00:09:41,973 --> 00:09:43,440
Here.

63
00:09:44,273 --> 00:09:45,440
Calm down.

64
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,940
What's wrong ?

65
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:50,673
Take care of the girl, I'm giving
this guy my contact information.

66
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:54,840
It's just a cut above the
eyebrow, does it hurt?

67
00:09:55,806 --> 00:09:57,240
Can you move it?

68
00:09:57,440 --> 00:10:00,873
- Let's take her to the emergency room.
- I'm coming.

69
00:10:01,073 --> 00:10:02,573
Here are my contact details.

70
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,973
Still there ?  I was inside.

71
00:10:19,173 --> 00:10:23,040
It's my day off, I can wait.

72
00:10:23,306 --> 00:10:24,840
- Did we examine her?
- Yes.

73
00:10:24,973 --> 00:10:27,673
It's just his leg,
ice cream will do,

74
00:10:27,873 --> 00:10:29,873
and she has a scrape
above her eyebrow.

75
00:10:30,540 --> 00:10:33,673
They took me for his mother,
like that madman before!

76
00:10:33,873 --> 00:10:36,640
- No, too young.
- The girl ?

77
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:40,340
- No you.
- Finally someone sane!  THANKS.

78
00:10:40,540 --> 00:10:42,573
- Did you know her?
- No.

79
00:10:42,773 --> 00:10:45,173
My scooter knew her.

80
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:48,406
- I just know that her name is Adriana.
- I am Ettore.

81
00:10:49,606 --> 00:10:50,806
Elena.

82
00:10:51,973 --> 00:10:54,240
Like the story of Homer!

83
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:57,006
- It was our Odyssey.
- The Iliad.

84
00:10:58,140 --> 00:11:00,540
Ettore and Elena are in The Iliad.

85
00:11:02,473 --> 00:11:04,673
She'll be back in 15 minutes.

86
00:11:17,373 --> 00:11:20,973
- Can I walk you home?
- I'm ok thanks.

87
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:24,373
- It was a pleasure.
- For me too.

88
00:11:24,573 --> 00:11:26,373
Apart from the accident.

89
00:11:39,273 --> 00:11:41,540
- He wasn't your husband?
- No !

90
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:46,006
- Too old, don't you think?
- You made a great couple.

91
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:50,073
- Do you live there?
- No, somewhere else.

92
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:51,740
You could have
been brought back...

93
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:55,640
My father's office is here, my
mother must not see me like this.

94
00:11:56,406 --> 00:11:58,973
My father is more... lax.

95
00:11:59,206 --> 00:12:02,006
He still feels guilty
for abandoning us!

96
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:05,440
- Is that Dr. Villanova?
- Yes, you are his patient?

97
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,473
No, I read the plaque.

98
00:12:07,973 --> 00:12:10,040
Be careful now!

99
00:12:10,273 --> 00:12:12,773
I swear never to sit
on your scooter again.

100
00:12:12,973 --> 00:12:14,973
Or any other scooter,

101
00:12:15,173 --> 00:12:17,573
even less if you call.

102
00:12:17,773 --> 00:12:18,940
Bye.

103
00:12:21,873 --> 00:12:23,573
- THANKS.
- It was nothing.

104
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:27,840
Elena!

105
00:12:28,373 --> 00:12:29,573
You smell good.

106
00:12:30,473 --> 00:12:31,473
THANKS.

107
00:12:44,973 --> 00:12:46,173
Wait !

108
00:12:47,173 --> 00:12:50,606
- Yes ?
- Dad isn't here, are you taking me?

109
00:12:51,606 --> 00:12:53,940
- I only have one helmet.
- It's not far.

110
00:12:54,140 --> 00:12:57,406
- But one helmet for two...
- I can't with that leg!

111
