No, Marco, don't
take my picture,

141
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,540
I hate being photographed!

142
00:15:42,406 --> 00:15:44,206
I said no !

143
00:15:46,206 --> 00:15:48,373
I love when you get angry!

144
00:15:48,573 --> 00:15:50,773
You've never seen
me really angry.

145
00:15:50,973 --> 00:15:53,572
- Are you afraid that I'll steal your soul?
- Are you afraid I'll steal this?

146
00:15:53,573 --> 00:15:54,806
Sorry...

147
00:15:57,606 --> 00:15:59,340
He is single, handsome,

148
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:01,040
he came to my house

149
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,673
and should stay there.

150
00:16:02,873 --> 00:16:04,473
One of us must have it.

151
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:06,806
It's a matter of principle.

152
00:16:07,006 --> 00:16:09,773
Bachelor ?
He's not with that redhead?

153
00:16:09,973 --> 00:16:11,206
No way...

154
00:16:11,406 --> 00:16:13,806
She told me it was just
a working relationship.

155
00:16:14,673 --> 00:16:16,773
What can I say ?
Do it yourself if you want.

156
00:16:16,973 --> 00:16:18,473
I don't need your permission.

157
00:16:19,973 --> 00:16:22,140
But I think he prefers you.

158
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,673
- Don't make that face.
- What head?

159
00:16:24,873 --> 00:16:25,973
This stupid face.

160
00:16:27,606 --> 00:16:29,873
What to say ?  That I like ?

161
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:32,840
Yes, a lot.

162
00:16:34,273 --> 00:16:35,273
SO ?

163
00:16:38,973 --> 00:16:40,140
SO...

164
00:16:40,473 --> 00:16:42,740
Let's make a bet:
the first to do so, wins.

165
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:45,373
Stop it, we're not 16 anymore!

166
00:16:45,973 --> 00:16:48,273
We don't care, let's
use our last cartridges.

167
00:16:49,673 --> 00:16:51,006
What is the price ?

168
00:16:51,206 --> 00:16:53,173
Him !

169
00:16:55,173 --> 00:16:57,473
We look like lesbians.

170
00:17:12,573 --> 00:17:15,340
- Why did we come?
- For the bet.

171
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:34,840
- What a bitch.
- Isn't she a model?

172
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,806
Not her, Marco.

173
00:17:37,006 --> 00:17:40,273
Look how he struts around,
like he's the only one.

174
00:17:43,606 --> 00:17:47,373
He seduces them all:
ugly, beautiful, young, old.

175
00:17:47,573 --> 00:17:50,640
- You give up ?
- No my Darling.

176
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,206
He makes promises to everyone,

177
00:17:53,673 --> 00:17:55,773
but do not attach themselves to anyone.

178
00:17:58,973 --> 00:18:00,806
Watch and learn.

179
00:18:01,006 --> 00:18:02,573
Wait Baby.

180
00:18:03,206 --> 00:18:06,140
- Why don't we leave?
- What is the problem ?

181
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:09,006
I'm not having fun.

182
00:18:09,806 --> 00:18:12,806
Marco annoys me, I don't
know why.  We're going.

183
00:18:13,006 --> 00:18:15,606
Please, another 10
minutes and we're leaving.

184
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,073
Stay,

185
00:18:18,273 --> 00:18:19,806
see you at home.

186
00:18:55,606 --> 00:18:57,973
What an idiot... I'm coming!

187
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:01,140
Roberta, I hate it
when you do that!

188
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,640
Oh my God.

189
00:19:10,873 --> 00:19:12,473
I preferred the other outfit.

190
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:16,440
- Do you want to come in?
- Yeah.

191
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:25,940
- The exhibition ?
- The inauguration is over.

192
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:29,273
And Baby?  Where is she ?

193
00:19:30,806 --> 00:19:33,440
At a party, I don't
know with whom.

194
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:35,873
Sit down.

195
00:19:36,073 --> 00:19:37,340
THANKS.

196
00:19:40,573 --> 00:19:41,806
What are you doing here ?

197
00:19:42,006 --> 00:19:43,673
I learned for the bet!

198
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:48,040
Roberta told me everything.

199
00:19:49,406 --> 00:19:52,806
She can't hold her tongue.
She likes to share.

200
00:19:53,006 --> 00:19:55,540
She also said that you gave up.

201
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:58,173
I came to ask you why.

202
00:19:58,373 --> 00:20:00,140
It was a stupid game.

203
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:02,340
Why did you stop playing?

204
00:20:03,206 --> 00:20:05,246
Maybe because I
didn't love you enough.

205
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:08,173
- How nice.
- You came to hear it.

206
00:20:11,473 --> 00:20:13,940
Maybe you don't like
me as a photographer.

207
00:20:15,473 --> 00:20:17,673
You may not like me as a person.

208
00:20:20,473 --> 00:20:22,273
It's so embarrassing.

209
00:20:23,406 --> 00:20:25,940
You don't attract me.

210
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:28,740
Rejecting me is an
admission of your feelings.

211
00:20:31,473 --> 00:20:34,673
- I'm sleepy, I'm going to sleep.
- Are you dumping me?

212
00:20:34,873 --> 00:20:38,173
You can stay if you
want, but I'm going to bed.

213
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:43,006
OK.

214
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:45,806
I'll let you sleep.

215
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:48,640
We can at least be friends.

216
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,740
- Of course.
- So I can ask you out.

217
00:20:52,373 --> 00:20:55,640
Not a date, not a
candlelight dinner.

218
00:20:56,540 --> 00:20:59,806
- Tomorrow, I take special photos.
- What do you mean ?

219
00:21:00,006 --> 00:21:02,040
You will only know if you come.

220
00:21:04,340 --> 00:21:06,940
If I had the courage I
would steal this notebook.

221
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:09,340
I would love to know what he writes!

222
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:13,573
- Stealing his soul isn't enough for you?
- Don't lecture me.

223
00:21:13,773 --> 00:21:16,940
- Stealing souls is my job.
- My God no...

224
00:21:17,140 --> 00:21:20,140
But I'd say you're taking
advantage of his grief.

225
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:22,540
I hate being photographed
without being asked.

226
00:21:22,740 --> 00:21:24,740
I just want to tell his story.

227
00:21:25,006 --> 00:21:26,206
Tell me,

228
00:21:26,406 --> 00:21:28,206
