229
00:21:30,106 --> 00:21:33,240
Do they ease his pain?

230
00:21:33,873 --> 00:21:36,740
They calm his obsessive writing?

231
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:39,773
And on what?
Maybe he's writing about you!

232
00:21:39,940 --> 00:21:42,340
About this asshole who's been
following him for two months.

233
00:21:42,473 --> 00:21:44,173
What kind of relationship is it?

234
00:21:44,373 --> 00:21:48,740
It gives you the opportunity to express
yourself.  What are you giving him?

235
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:51,040
What the fuck are you giving her?

236
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,640
Do not try !

237
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:51,340
Adriana?

238
00:22:52,473 --> 00:22:55,373
I licked you everywhere last night... It
was beautiful and crazy at the same time...

239
00:23:16,540 --> 00:23:19,873
I wrote it down, but
you know the building.

240
00:23:20,073 --> 00:23:22,473
The doctor's name, the
date, the time... Here.

241
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:27,606
- You understand ?
- Silence, I don't want him to see me.

242
00:23:27,806 --> 00:23:30,740
- Why did we come here?
- Here it is !

243
00:23:33,406 --> 00:23:34,540
SO ?

244
00:23:35,806 --> 00:23:37,673
He has a tattooed eyebrow,

245
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:40,006
he's fat,

246
00:23:40,206 --> 00:23:42,340
he is tanned, he must be 20 years old...

247
00:23:42,540 --> 00:23:44,140
what does it represent to you?

248
00:23:44,340 --> 00:23:45,573
Nothing...

249
00:23:46,140 --> 00:23:49,073
that's why I need a shrink,
it's never happened to me!

250
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:52,080
I order groceries
every day, just to see it,

251
00:23:52,273 --> 00:23:55,473
I offered him a coffee
once, his name is Vasco...

252
00:23:55,673 --> 00:23:59,573
You can't be in love, it
must be a hormonal break!

253
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,740
I want him to see me.

254
00:24:07,173 --> 00:24:08,406
Sorry.

255
00:24:13,573 --> 00:24:16,640
- Elena, wait,
- He didn't even say hello.

256
00:24:16,840 --> 00:24:20,206
- He didn't see me.
- We passed him!

257
00:24:20,406 --> 00:24:23,240
You saw it !  He is shy.

258
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,640
Shy.

259
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:28,073
- Can we go back?
- No, you're making a fool of yourself.

260
00:24:29,273 --> 00:24:31,273
- You think ?
- Yes.

261
